title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The live check
route: /authorizations/eligibility/verify
intro: What the person sees after 'Check now'. The form locks and the 'Live check' card on the right ticks off one agent at a time, about 10 seconds in all. The questions themselves are in the next diagram.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the waiting is a timer. Nothing is sent to any payer.
---
start s1 "Click 'Check now'"
process p1 "Form fields, 'Use sample card', the 'Try a sample' chips and the card drop lock\nThe button reads 'Checking' with a spinner"
screen sc "Card 'Live check'\n'Each agent asks the right source and reports back'"

group gRows "Agent rows"
  screen r1 "Waiting\nAgent name, grey text 'Will ask Ohio Medicaid whether coverage is active', clock and 'Waiting', dimmed"
  screen r2 "Checking\nAgent name, 'Asking Ohio Medicaid whether coverage is active on 10/21/2026', spinner and 'Checking'"
  screen r3 "Done\nAgent name, the answer, green tick and a small time such as 0:02"
endgroup

screen tm "Timer pill beside the title\nShows 0:00 and counts up each second"
click k1 "Click 'Skip ahead' (shown only while running)"
process p2 "Every step still to run takes 0.15 seconds instead of 1.4 to 2.6"
decision q1 "Last step ticked?"
toast t1 "Banner 'All answers are in. Opening the result.'"
wait w1 "Half a second so the last tick is seen"
screen ft "Footer line\n'If a system does not answer, Caller phones the payer and logs the call.'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The live check: the agents' questions"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The check finishes and is saved"

s1 --> p1 --> sc
sc --> r1
r1 --> r2 --> r3
sc --> tm
sc --> ft
sc -.-> g1
r3 --> q1
q1 -->|No| r1
q1 -->|Yes| t1 --> w1 --> g2
r2 -.-> k1 --> p2 -.-> r3
